  "translation": "A fɛrɛ fana, Yosiya ye ⟨את⟩ obuw, ani ⟨את⟩ yidoniw, ani ⟨את⟩ terafimu, ani ⟨את⟩ gilulimu, ani ⟨את⟩ kɔnsɔbɛ bɛɛ minnu ye Yuda dugukolo la ani Yerushalayim, ka bo yen, walasa ka Tora kumaw jiŋe minnu sɛbɛnna sɛbɛn sanfɛ, min Hilikiya sarakalasebaga tun ye a so Yawe so kɔnɔ.",
